<p class="wp-block-paragraph">It was a fun week in the Labs with a lot of meetups. We started with the Saturday meetup, which was wide-ranging, and then we had a deep dive with the Pathfinders on Thursday that dug into the new beta software. On top of that, there were several new videos and podcasts released.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Below you&#8217;ll find the week&#8217;s new videos and podcasts, a few of the conversations happening in the member community, and what&#8217;s coming next week. Most of those links lead straight into the Labs community on Circle, so they&#8217;ll only open if you&#8217;re a member. If you&#8217;re a Labs member who hasn&#8217;t set up your Circle access yet, send me a note and I&#8217;ll get you in. For members, this is your week at a glance. If you&#8217;re not one yet, <a href="https://www.macsparky.com/join/">it&#8217;s a peek at what you&#8217;re missing</a>.</p>



